# Only the playable game goes in the repository: the web page, its scripts and three.js, the
# local launcher, and the Godot desktop version with the script that bakes its assets. The
# reference sheets, the dev tools (model viewer, contact sheets) and the editor settings stay
# on this machine. Godot's own import cache (godot/.godot/) is ignored by godot/.gitignore.
/*
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/.nojekyll
!/.gitignore
!/Play Trap Trick.bat
!/css/
!/js/
!/lib/
!/godot/
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/serve.py
!/tools/bake_godot.js
!/tools/make_audio.py
